 "discussions": [
  {
   "id": "d_m16",
   "title": "Discussion: Who Won the Cold War?",
   "html": "<div id=\"sparkled-assessment\"><div style=\"background:#1B1D20; border-bottom:4px solid #4A5058; border-radius:10px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:20px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px; color:#E8C95A; margin-bottom:6px;\"><strong>DISCUSSION</strong></div><div style=\"font-family:'Alegreya',Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif; font-size:26px; color:#FFFFFF; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:6px;\">Discussion: Who Won the Cold War?</div><div style=\"font-size:15px; color:#E9ECEF;\">10 points · threaded discussion</div></div><div style=\"border-top:3px double #4A5058; margin:0 0 20px;\"></div><div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DCD4C4; border-top:4px solid #7A5A00; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:18px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#7A5A00; color:#FFFFFF; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Before you start</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px;\">Open the lessons \"The Reagan Years and the Soviet Squeeze\" and \"The Wall Falls\". Use My Notebook on those pages to gather your notes and marks, then come back here to post.</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DCD4C4; border-top:4px solid #1B1D20; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:18px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#1B1D20; color:#FFFFFF; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>The question</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px;\">The Cold War ended without a nuclear war, and the Soviet Union ceased to exist. Many people and forces helped bring that about: leaders, armies, economies, and ordinary citizens in the streets. Who, or what, deserves the most credit? And does the word \"won\" even fit?</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DCD4C4; border-top:4px solid #4A5058; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:18px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#4A5058; color:#FFFFFF; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Your post</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px;\"><strong>Your post (about 100 to 150 words):</strong></p><ol style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 6px; padding-left:22px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Take a clear position: name the person, group, or cause that you think deserves the most credit, or argue that no single one does.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Give one specific piece of evidence from the lesson \"The Reagan Years and the Soviet Squeeze\" or the source Ronald Reagan, Address to the National Association of Evangelicals (The \"Evil Empire\" Speech) that supports you.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">Name one fact that cuts against your position, and explain why you still hold it.</li></ol></div><div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DCD4C4; border-top:4px solid #7A5A00; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:18px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#7A5A00; color:#FFFFFF; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Your reply</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px;\"><strong>Your reply (about 50 to 75 words):</strong> Respond to one classmate. Do you agree with their reasoning? If so, strengthen it with something they did not use. If not, say respectfully where their reasoning falls short.</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DCD4C4; border-top:4px solid #1B1D20; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:18px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#1B1D20; color:#FFFFFF; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Before you post</strong></div><p style=\"font-size:17px; color:#1C1B1A; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 10px;\">Post first, then reply. You will not see your classmates' posts until you have posted.</p></div><div style=\"background:#FFFDF8; border:1px solid #DCD4C4; border-top:4px solid #1B1D20; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; margin-bottom:18px;\"><div style=\"display:inline-block; background:#1B1D20; color:#FFFFFF; font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:12px;\"><strong>Rubric</strong></div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; margin-top:6px;\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #DCD4C4; padding:8px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; background:#E9ECEF; font-size:14px; width:22%;\">Post and reply<br><span style=\"color:#4A5058;\">10.0 pts</span></th><td style=\"border:1px solid #DCD4C4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top; font-size:14px;\"><strong>10.0 pts</strong> Substantive<br><span style=\"color:#55524C;\">Clear position, specific evidence from the week, names a counterpoint, and the reply engages a classmate's actual reasoning</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #DCD4C4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top; font-size:14px;\"><strong>6.0 pts</strong> Thin<br><span style=\"color:#55524C;\">Position stated but evidence vague, no counterpoint, or the reply only says \"I agree\"</span></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #DCD4C4; padding:8px; vertical-align:top; font-size:14px;\"><strong>0.0 pts</strong> Missing<br><span style=\"color:#55524C;\">No post, or no reply</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>",
